WEBVTT

00:06:29.941 --> 00:06:34.728
ndoa za utotoni, uonevu wa kimtandao,
shule salama, migogoro inayoumiza--

00:06:34.752 --> 00:06:36.352
na listi inaendelea na kuendelea.

00:06:36.903 --> 00:06:38.836
Watoto hao ni wa muhimu sana.

00:06:40.101 --> 00:06:42.085
Hivyo tuna uongozi wa kisiasa,

00:06:42.109 --> 00:06:43.863
tuna wanaharakati wadogo,

00:06:43.887 --> 00:06:45.764
tuna suluhu zilizothibitishwa

00:06:47.551 --> 00:06:49.277
tuna uelewa wa jamii unaoongezeka--

00:06:49.301 --> 00:06:50.361
tuko katika njia hiyo,

00:06:50.385 --> 00:06:52.884
tumeanza safari hiyo
kutokomeza kabisa ifikapo 2030.

00:06:53.411 --> 00:06:55.344
Lakini suluhu hiso ni zipi?

00:06:56.061 --> 00:06:57.776
Miaka mitatu iliyopita, 2016,

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:02.212
taasisi 10 za kiulimwengu zilikutana
na kujipanga katika mpango